WEBVTT

00:12:27.989 --> 00:12:32.421
sometimes we easily give our power of choice away.

00:12:32.421 --> 00:12:34.217
We identify with the guru

00:12:34.217 --> 00:12:35.496
who tells us what to do,

00:12:35.496 --> 00:12:38.140
self-help therapist,

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:40.919
or we embrace a totalitarian leader

00:12:40.919 --> 00:12:43.706
who appears to have no doubts about choices,

00:12:43.706 --> 00:12:45.790
who sort of knows.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:48.566
Now, often people ask me,

00:12:48.566 --> 00:12:50.940
"What did you learn by studying choice?"

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:54.111
And there is an important message that I did learn.

00:12:54.111 --> 00:12:56.598
When thinking about choices,

00:12:56.598 --> 00:13:01.558
I stopped taking choices too seriously, personally.